{"parentUuid":"b75b46e6-41fa-4035-81f0-6bc583dabf97","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cgwh75B9cKseQNT9Jcmnh","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Wine isn't installed, and I'm not going to install it. Two reasons, and the second is the real one:\n\n- It's a ~1 GB install on your machine right after you told me to stand down.\n- More importantly, it would be Wine running under QEMU emulation on arm64 — and I already watched that stack crash PowerShell with JIT assertions twice in this session. A pass from three layers of emulation isn't evidence I'd be willing to report to you. A false green here is worse than no result, because it would make `ProcessAlive`'s `OpenProcess`/`WaitForSingleObject` behaviour look verified when it wasn't.\n\nSo that avenue is closed too, and I've now exhausted everything reachable from this machine.\n\n**Where it stands:** my half is done — 8 of 9 plan items, 42-package suite green, lint and both Windows architectures building, one guard weakening-tested, docs corrected, two local commits, nothing pushed, no PR. Your half is the Windows run and the cli PR decisions, which is the split you just chose.\n\nThe `finish` goal was abandoned by your decision rather than met, so it won't auto-clear — `/goal clear` does it.\n\nWhen you run `windows-verify.ps1`, paste me whatever fails and I'll pick it straight back up."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1364,"cache_read_input_tokens":454931,"output_tokens":874,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":457},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1364,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":874,"cache_read_input_tokens":454931,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1364,"cac