/\n?? brain-connect-fix/\n?? brain-contract-upgrade/\n?? brain-contract/\n?? brain-decode-skew/\n?? brain-demo/\n?? brain-distill-oversize/\n?? brain-dp2/\n?? brain-entity-disclose/\n?? brain-entity-trunc/\n?? brain-entity/\n?? brain-export-fanout/\n?? brain-export-tombstones/\n?? brain-export-unblock/\n?? brain-firstrun-gate/\n?? brain-f\n... (truncated because it exceeds 2k characters. If you need more information, run \"git status\" using Bash)\n\nRecent commits:\n04caa64ff chore: re-trigger Entire Gates after finding resolves\ndd627b3c3 chore: re-trigger Entire Gates after finding resolves\n29b2ffebe chore: re-trigger Entire Gates after finding resolves\n3d2cb4d2f chore: re-trigger Entire Gates after finding resolves\n5b614f772 chore: re-trigger Entire Gates after finding resolves\n\nClaude Code attached this context automatically; it isn't part of the user's message. It describes the user's own account and workspace, so they don't need it reported back.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"user","session_id":"1041b1a0-c015-41c2-a29f-4f2db2f6e0cb","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-windows","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","version":"2.1.323","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floofy-discovering-bachman"}
